# Schedule reference for factorbacktest cron jobs.
#
# These jobs are executed by GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/cron.yml), not by
# a Fly machine. Each job POSTs to the API with X-Cron-Secret; Fly web scales
# from zero on the incoming HTTP request.
#
# Times are America/New_York (weekdays only).

# Morning saved-strategy summary email - 8:30am ET on weekdays.
# 30 8 * * 1-5  ->  sendSavedStrategySummaryEmails

# Ingest adjusted prices before rebalance - 9:00am ET on weekdays.
# 0 9 * * 1-5  ->  updatePrices

# Trigger portfolio rebalancing - 10:00am ET on weekdays.
# 0 10 * * 1-5  ->  rebalance

# Poll pending broker orders during the trading day so completed fills are reflected in local state.
# */15 10-16 * * 1-5  ->  updateOrders
